h-performance wired networks.</p><p><br></p><p>The switch provides a 195W PoE budget, allowing compatible PoE+ devices such as wireless access points, IP phones, and security cameras to receive both power and network connectivity through Ethernet cabling. The four 10G SFP+ ports provide high-speed uplink connectivity for aggregation and backbone applications.</p><p><br></p><p>As a managed Cisco Catalyst switch, the C1000-24P-4X-L supports advanced Layer 2 functionality and can be managed through Cisco IOS, CLI, and an on-box web interface. It is suitable for businesses looking for reliable, secure, and manageable network infrastructure.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>24 × 10/100/1000 Mbps Gigabit Ethernet PoE+ ports</li><li>4 × 10G SFP+ uplink ports</li><li>195W total PoE budget</li><li>Managed Layer 2 switch</li><li>Cisco IOS Software</li><li>Web-based management and CLI</li><li>Advanced network security and reliability features</li><li>Designed for SMB, branch office, and IoT deployments</li><li>1U rack-mount form factor</li><li>High-speed 10G uplink connectivity</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco Nexus 9300 N9K-C93180YC-EX 48x 10/25GbE SFP28 + 6x 100GbE QSFP28 Network Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-9300-n9k-c93180yc-ex-48x-1025gbe-sfp28-6x-100gbe-qsfp28-network-switch","now":"155,000৳","old":"160,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ L3 Web Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-l3-web-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"24,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco Nexus N3K-3064PQ-10GX –48-Port 10G SFP+ Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-n3k-3064pq-10gx-%E2%80%9348-port-10g-sfp-switch","now":"70,000৳","old":"75,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba Networking CX 8325-32C 32-Port 100G QSFP+/QSFP28 Data Center/Core Switch","href":"/hpe-aruba-networking